[gd_scene load_steps=9 format=3]

; HEAVY MINE — placed, anti-vehicle, 160 damage.
;
; Reads as something you put DOWN rather than throw: a broad squat puck with a
; carry handle on top, a pressure ring proud of the lid, and folding anchor
; spurs. Wide and low, because it is meant to be spotted late by something with
; wheels rather than seen early by something with eyes.
;
; House palette from machine_gun_model.tscn. No emissive — the arming state is
; a job for a light the code turns on, not for baked paint.

